  ID: Base_Artifact_ViperWristlet
  Name: Viper Wristlet
  Description: Damage at the start of combat is increased by 20% for you and your
    allies within your support aura.\nOnce every 90 seconds, you and your ally in
    your support aura will gain a protective shell if your health drops to 15%. The
    shell removes all control effects and restores 30% of health over 5 seconds,
    reducing incoming damage by 80%. The same character cannot gain the shell more
    than once every 90 seconds.
